  "t0058": "The depths as they are.",
  "t0059": "Hard",
  "t0060": "Deadlier than Normal: stronger monsters, more of them, and oil flasks restore less. Embers brought back ×1.5.",
  "t0061": "No omen tonight. The depths are as they have always been.",
  "t0062": "Fog",
  "t0063": "Light radius −1; monsters also see you only within 6 tiles.",
  "t0064": "Plenty",
  "t0065": "One more oil flask per floor, and oil restores 10 more; monsters +15% HP.",
  "t0066": "Mad Moon",
  "t0067": "Monsters act faster; +50% XP from kills.",
  "t0068": "Gold Rain",
  "t0069": "Double gold on the ground; merchants charge 30% more.",
  "t0070": "Silence",
  "t0071": "Most monsters are asleep; more traps.",
  "t0072": "Fire Season",
  "t0073": "More grass, faster-spreading fire; you start knowing the Potion of Ember.",
  "t0074": "Blood Moon",
  "t0075": "A blood altar on every floor from 2 to 9, at half the price; monsters ATK +1.",
  "t0076": "Hardy",
  "t0077": "Starting max HP +4",
