  "t0084": "Lore",
  "t0085": "Start knowing two random potions or talismans",
  "t0086": "Long Wick",
  "t0087": "Oil use −8%",
  "t0088": "“The left-hand wall seeps. Don't sleep against it.”",
  "t0089": "“Spiders make no sound when they move. If one bites you, its silk tangles your feet and slows you down.”",
  "t0090": "“The merchant never says how he got down here. I don't dare ask.”",
  "t0091": "“Add oil before the lamp goes out. Once it does, the dark starts biting, one mouthful at a time.”",
  "t0092": "“I left my last Potion of Healing for whoever comes next. It's under the…” (The rest is torn away.)",
  "t0093": "“The statues do move. Only slowly. So slowly you'd think they never did.”",
  "t0094": "“Daughter, if you're reading this, don't come down.”",
  "t0095": "“It gets warmer the deeper you go. Don't be fooled. The warm places are the most dangerous.”",
  "t0096": "“When an ember sac starts to glow, one step back is enough. It took me three tries to learn that.”",
  "t0097": "“Every lamp-keeper thinks they'll be the one who's different.”",
  "t0098": "“The Light Eater fears candlelight. Lure it beside a lit brazier: your blows hurt twice as much, and its wounds won’t close.”",
  "t0099": "“There are too many marks on the wall to count now. I don't remember which one I was.”",
  "t0100": "cave rat",
  "t0101": "Quick but fragile. Always comes in twos and threes.",
  "t0102": "lamp moth",
  "t0103": "Drawn to light; flies at you from far away, and each bite eats 4 oil. Hood your lamp and it can't find you.",
  "t0104": "bat",
  "t0105": "Flits about unpredictably. Hates bright light: keeps away while your lamp is strong (radius 5 or more).",
  "t0106": "sludge",
  "t0107": "Splits when wounded.",
  "t0108": "skeleton",
  "t0109": "A guardian of the dead. When it falls, 40% chance it pieces itself back together 4 turns later; not if it dies by fire or its bones are burned.",
  "t0110": "cave spider",
  "t0111": "Its bite may bind you in silk. Light-footed: you can't hear it while hooded.",
  "t0112": "bone archer",
  "t0113": "Keeps its distance and shoots, but must reload for a turn after each shot (marked 填). Rush it then. When it falls, 20% chance it pieces itself back together 4 turns later; not if it dies by fire or its bones are burned.",
  "t0114": "grey wolf",
  "t0115": "Faster than you; don't try to run. When one finds you, it howls for every wolf nearby.",
  "t0116": "ember sac",
  "t0117": "Swells up when close and bursts the next turn. Fire sets it off at once, so you can detonate it.",
  "t0118": "shade",
  "t0119": "Shows itself only within 2 tiles. Fears light: while your lamp is strong (radius 5 or more), you deal +50% damage to it. Silent: you can't hear it while hooded.",
  "t0120": "ash priest",
  "t0121": "Casts fireballs, and blinks away when you get close.",
  "t0122": "statue",
  "t0123": "Slow, hard, deadly. It never moves while lit; it only creeps closer in the dark. Once beside you, it attacks all the same.",
  "t0124": "wraith",
  "t0125": "Passes through walls. Fiercest in the dark: double attack while you're hooded or out of oil. It drifts, so you can't hear it while hooded.",
  "t0126": "Warden",
  "t0127": "Carries the key that breaks the seal.",
  "t0128": "mimic",
  "t0129": "It has been waiting all along for you to open it.",
