  "t0468": "<h2>The Lamp City Workshop</h2><p class=\"muted\">Every descent, win or lose, brings back some embers: the deeper you go, the more monsters you slay and the more torn pages you find, the more embers you bring. Upgrades here are permanent (except in the Daily Challenge, to keep it fair).</p><p>You have <b style=\"color:var(--ember)\">{0}</b> embers.</p>\n <div class=\"inv\">{1}</div>\n <div class=\"row\" style=\"margin-top:14px\"><button class=\"btn\" id=\"wBack\">Back</button></div>",
