  "t0485": "<div class=\"title\"><h1>Emberlamp Abyss</h1><div class=\"en\">燼燈深淵</div>\n <p>Carry a lamp down ten floors and bring back the Emberheart. The oil burns all the way down, and once it runs dry, the dark begins to feed.</p>\n <div class=\"stack\">\n {0}\n <button class=\"choice\" id=\"tNew\"><b>New Journey</b><span>Choose a class and enter randomly generated depths{1}</span></button>\n <button class=\"choice\" id=\"tDaily\"><b>Daily Challenge</b><span>{2} · Everyone walks the same depths today</span></button>\n </div>\n <div class=\"quad2\" style=\"margin-top:8px\">\n  <button class=\"btn sub\" id=\"tShop\" type=\"button\">Workshop<small>{3} embers</small></button>\n  <button class=\"btn sub\" id=\"tStory\" type=\"button\">Journal<small>{4} / 9 pages</small></button>\n  <button class=\"btn sub\" id=\"tHelp\" type=\"button\">Help<small>Controls, legend</small></button>\n  <button class=\"btn sub\" id=\"tSet\" type=\"button\">Settings<small>Sound · display</small></button>\n </div>\n <h3>Records</h3><div class=\"stats recs\"><div><small>Deepest</small><strong>{5}</strong></div><div><small>Best score</small><strong>{6}</strong></div><div><small>Clears</small><strong>{7}</strong></div><div><small>Hard clears</small><strong>{8}</strong></div><div><small>Hard classes</small><strong>{9} / 8</strong></div><div><small>Runs</small><strong>{10}</strong></div></div>\n</div>",
