  "t0580": "<h2>Blood Altar</h2><p>The grooves in the stone are cracked and black. Offer blood, and receive strength.</p><p class=\"muted\">Cost: max HP permanently −{0} (now {1}). Gain: one talent choice. The altar can be used only once.</p>\n <div class=\"row\"><button class=\"btn hot\" id=\"aYes\">Offer</button><button class=\"btn\" id=\"aNo\">Leave</button></div>",
  "t0581": "Your body cannot bear the cost.",
  "t0582": "The altar drinks your blood, then cracks apart.",
  "t0583": "<h2>Dark Spring</h2><p>The water is so black you can't see the bottom, and the lamplight on its surface is brighter than the lamp in your hand.</p><p class=\"muted\">No one can say what happens if you drink. There is only enough for one draught.</p>\n <div class=\"row\"><button class=\"btn hot\" id=\"fYes\">Drink</button><button class=\"btn\" id=\"fNo\">Leave</button></div>",
  "t0584": "The cold water heals all your wounds.",
  "t0585": "The water settles deep inside you. Max HP +5.",
  "t0586": "The spring is lamp oil! You fill your lamp.",
  "t0587": "The water is bitter. You've been poisoned.",
  "t0588": "The spring has run dry.",
