  "ui_gp_on": "Controller connected.",
  "ui_gp_title": "Controller",
  "ui_gp_help": "D-pad / left stick: move (hold to keep walking) · A: interact / descend · B: wait · X: skill · Y: bag · LB: hood · RB: explore · LT / RT / L3: quick slots 1 / 2 / 3 · Menu: menu. In windows, the D-pad moves the cursor, A confirms, B goes back.",
  "ui_ev_toggle": "Event art",
  "ui_ev_altar": "Blood Altar",
  "ui_ev_fountain": "Dark Spring",
  "ui_ev_grave": "A Grave",
  "ui_ev_merchant": "The Merchant",
  "ui_ev_page": "Liao's Journal",
  "ui_ev_note": "A Nameless Delver's Scrap",
  "ui_gem_dropped": "; the gem pouch is full, so {0} falls at your feet",
  "ui_help_bag_title": "Bag, Gems & Merchant",
  "ui_help_bag": "Tap a gem on a gear card to remove it or move it to the other piece. Tap Quick 1 or Quick 2 to put an identified potion or talisman in a quick slot; tap a quick slot above to clear it. “Drop” and “Sell” both take two taps. Potions and talismans on a merchant’s stall show their real names, and browsing them is enough to learn them. Gear stronger than yours is equipped as soon as you buy it. Forging can be repeated; the higher the level, the higher the price. Potions and talismans already identified as harmful are tossed when you pick them up.",
  "m_gen1": "\"Lamp's still lit, eh? Then we can still do business.\"",
  "m_gen2": "\"Fewer and fewer come down. Business gets harder every year.\"",
  "m_gen3": "\"Don't let my looks fool you. I came down here years before you.\"",
  "m_gen4": "\"No returns, no refunds. Down here, there's no such thing as regret.\"",
  "m_gen5": "\"Is the sky up there still dark? ...Of course it is, or you wouldn't be here.\"",
  "m_gen6": "\"Take your time. Down here, time is the cheapest thing there is.\"",
  "m_hurt": "\"You're bleeding. Buy a potion first. Dead folk don't shop.\"",
  "m_oil": "\"Your lamp's nearly out. I've got oil, and the price is negotiable.\"",
  "m_poor": "\"Short on coin? Then just look. Looking's free.\"",
  "m_rich": "\"Well, well, quite a haul. I saved the best goods for you.\"",
  "m_last": "\"Last stop. Whatever you need, buy it now.\"",
  "m_again": "\"You again? Or someone who looks just like you? The ones who come down all look the same to me.\"",
  "m_veteran": "\"You've come down more times than I've sold flasks of oil.\"",
  "m_pages": "\"You smell of Liao. ...Don't ask how I know that name.\"",
  "p_frugal_eff": "Oil burns at half rate below 30",
  "p_refill": "Refill",
  "p_refill_d": "Lamp oil restores 10 more and heals 3 HP",
  "p_refill_eff": "Oil +{0}, heal {1}",
  "ui_ev_continue": "Tap to continue",
  "ui_altar_spent": "The blood on the altar has dried.",
  "ui_fount_spent": "The spring has run dry; only cold, damp stone remains.",
  "n_tip1": "“A bone archer has to nock a new arrow after every shot. Wait for that gap, then rush it.”",
  "n_tip2": "“Burn the bones. If you don't, they get back up.”",
  "n_tip3": "“When you hear a howl, find a corner. Wolves never come alone.”",
  "n_tip4": "“Hood your lamp and the moths can’t find you. But the wraiths love nothing more than someone in the dark.”",
  "n_tip5": "“Shades fear light. The brighter your lamp, the deeper your blade bites.”",
  "n_tip6": "“Cut the sludge and you get more sludge. Finish it fast or leave it alone.”",
  "n_tip7": "“Don't trust every chest. Some of them bite.”",
  "n_tip8": "“When the big ones raise a hand, watch the floor. Wherever it lights up is about to burst.”",
  "n_tip9": "“Try unknown potions somewhere safe. Don't gamble with a monster in front of you.”",
  "n_tip10": "“I put two matching stones together, and they became one brighter stone.”",
  "n_tip11": "“The altar wants blood, not gold. Only give what you can spare.”",
  "n_tip12": "“Go back to where you fell. What you left behind may still be there.”",
  "n_tip13": "“When a crowd surrounds you, back into a corridor. In a narrow place, only one of them can reach you at a time.”",
  "n_tip14": "“An ember sac doesn't care who it burns. Lead it into the crowd before you strike.”",
  "n_tip15": "“If you can't win, hood the lamp and keep your distance. What can't see you slowly forgets you.”",
  "n_mood1": "“What day is it? I've trimmed the wick three times, so I'll call it three days.”",
  "n_mood2": "“If anyone finds my lamp, take it back to Lamp City. It still knows the way home.”",
  "n_mood3": "“I can hear someone singing further down. It's a song from Lamp City.”",
  "n_mood4": "“Don't count your heartbeat down here. Keep counting, and you'll hear a second one.”",
  "ui_sell_one": "Sells one at a time",
  "ui_memo_of": "The {0}'s memory",
  "ui_gem_moved": "; {0} gem(s) moved to the new gear",
  "ui_shop_learn": "Looking over the wares, you recognize: {0}.",
  "ui_zoom": "Zoom",
  "ui_settings": "Settings",
  "ui_set_sound": "Sound",
  "ui_set_view": "Display & language",
  "ui_help_seen": "Only what you have seen in the depths is recorded here ({0} / {1}).",
  "ui_ctrl": "Movement",
  "ui_ctrl_pad": "D-pad",
  "ui_ctrl_stick": "Joystick",
