  "ui_tut_sleep": "<h2>A sleeping enemy</h2><p>A sleeping {0} blocks the way ahead (note the “z” above it).</p><p>• Press <b>Hood</b> in the middle of the pad before you approach, and your light will not wake it.<br>• Once you are next to it, press <b>Attack</b>: a sneak attack deals double damage and never misses.</p><p class=\"muted\">Walk up with the lamp uncovered and it wakes. You can still win, it just hurts more. Press Hood again afterwards: you cannot see far with the lamp covered.</p>",
